sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant GUI as GUI - React
    participant Tauri as Tauri Backend
    participant Adapter as AgentAdapter (in-process)
    participant Bridge as bridge.rs (rc-agent-protocol)
    participant Runner as rc-runner (shared)
    participant CP as Control Plane

    User->>GUI: Type prompt
    GUI->>Tauri: Tauri invoke send_prompt
    Tauri->>Adapter: send_message(session_id, prompt)

    Note over Adapter: Adapter calls native engine\nClaude / Roo / Codex in-process\nNo subprocess, no HTTP

    loop For each agent event
        Adapter-->>Tauri: mpsc Receiver of UnifiedAgentEvent

        Tauri->>Bridge: unified_event_to_runtime_detail(event)
        Bridge-->>Tauri: Option<RuntimeEventDetail>

        alt Detail is Some
            Tauri->>GUI: Tauri app.emit() runtime event JSON
            Tauri->>CP: POST /v1/sessions/id/events RuntimeEventDetail
        else Detail is None - lifecycle
            Note over Tauri: Skip for lifecycle events\n(QueryStarted, StreamMessage*, etc.)
        end
    end

    Note over GUI: RemoteApp.tsx renders\nTimelineCard per event

    alt Permission request
        Adapter-->>Tauri: PermissionRequest event
        Tauri->>GUI: Show permission modal
        User->>GUI: Approve/Deny
        GUI->>Tauri: resolve_permission_request
        Tauri->>Adapter: resolve_permission(decision)
    end
